                                "sense_id": "d619ccd7-8d0e-355a-bf22-b81d9078aff0",
                                "text": "A fly ash material used in a study (by Xie and Xi) contained a high fraction of reactive oxides which reacted significantly with a waterglass (Na₂SiO₃) activator, leading to a high strength within a short time and under relatively lower temperatures"
